#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0640 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when SDTM SUPPAE contains a record with QNAM=AETRTEM for a subject but AETRTEM is not a column of the corresponding ADVERSE EVENT sub-class OCCDS (ADaM) dataset.
#note "Written FIRST in runbook W2a (PLAN-operation-replacements phase 0). The mirror of -invalid_aetrtem_only_in_suppae: AETRTEM reaches the requirement only through the SUPPAE QNAM pivot, and ADAE DOES carry the column -> not_exists false -> silent. Proves the pivot gates the rule in (the rule executes rather than SKIPs) without firing."
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASEQ type=Num
col AETRTEM type=Char
col AETERM type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | Y | HEADACHE
---

dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESEQ type=Num
col AETERM type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE
---

dataset SUPPAE label="Supplemental Qualifiers for AE"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col RDOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col IDVAR    type=Char
col IDVARVAL type=Char
col QNAM     type=Char
col QLABEL   type=Char
col QVAL     type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | AESEQ | 1 | AETRTEM | Treatment Emergent Flag | Y
---
